  data: {
    LLM: "Protect your high trumps. Since the 5 and Jack are so powerful, don't waste them on a trick you can win with a lower card. Use them to 'pull' trumps from your opponents.\n\nThe Ace of Hearts is your wildcard. Never forget that it is a trump. It can be a devastating surprise if your opponent leads a suit they think you are void in, only for you to 'Ace' them.\n\nBlack Suit Logic: Remember that in black suits (Spades/Clubs), the 2 is higher than the 10. This frequently trips up beginners. Use your low-number black cards to win non-trump tricks.",
    Player: "Protect your high trumps. Since the 5 and Jack are so powerful, don't waste them on a trick you can win with a lower card. Use them to 'pull' trumps from your opponents.\n\nThe Ace of Hearts is your wildcard. Never forget that it is a trump. It can be a devastating surprise if your opponent leads a suit they think you are void in, only for you to 'Ace' them.\n\nBlack Suit Logic: Remember that in black suits (Spades/Clubs), the 2 is higher than the 10. This frequently trips up beginners. Use your low-number black cards to win non-trump tricks.",
